Package: interfacespace
Type: Package
Title: Registers of Joint Qualitative-Quantitative Claims (Interface Spaces)
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Giampaolo", "Montaletti", , "giampaolo.montaletti@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-5327-1122"))
Description: Keeps the 'interface space' of a mixed methods evaluation: the
    set of joint qualitative-quantitative claims it produces, recorded as a
    register of findings (qualitative or quantitative strand),
    transformations of findings, headline claims, relations among claims
    (backs, clashes, covers) and append-only decisions with reasons. Status
    changes only through decisions taken by a person; machine-proposed rows
    enter as candidates. Jointness is computed by tracing each claim back
    through transformations to its root findings. The package ships the
    registers of ten published mixed methods evaluations of public services,
    with the coding protocol and the prompts used to propose rows, and
    reproduces their per-study counts.
